    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the thrust lever quadrant, its detent seal and the friction clamp assembly inside the centre pedestal, with the original and the bonded-face clamp standards.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the thrust lever quadrant detent seal, the friction clamp, the clamp mounting bracket and the anchor hardware inside the centre pedestal.",
      "figure_note": "The quadrant is supplied as an exchange assembly and the internal items are shown for identification only. Individual replacement of the detent seal on the aircraft is not permitted. The bonded-face friction clamp and the fluorosilicone seal are supplied together."
    },
